  "goodToKnow": "Die Publikation is a formal word for any published work: a book, an article, a report. In scientific contexts you'll hear Publikationsliste (list of publications) and wissenschaftliche Publikation. Das Publikum, by contrast, is the audience, the public. In everyday speech, people say Veröffentlichung or simply Buch and Artikel. Both words come from Latin publicare, to make public."
